  1 worker(s):   14.38 ms
  2 worker(s):   16.34 ms
  4 worker(s):   21.71 ms
  8 worker(s):   18.37 ms

  factorials:        {5: 120, 7: 5040, 10: 3628800, 12: 479001600, 15: 1307674368000}
  sum of factorials: 1308157003560

  No locks, no ordering constraints, no shared mutable state.  The only
  reason this is safe is that factorial is pure.  Make it write to a
  global and every one of those guarantees evaporates.
